    <p class="eyebrow">ROCKSTAROS / RELEASE STATUS</p>
    <h1>Not yet released.</h1>
    <p class="lead">A public RockstarOS installer is not available. Device Profile integration for avokado mini R5 is also incomplete.</p>
    <div class="notice" role="status"><strong>No device image is available</strong><p>This page does not connect over USB, erase a device, or write an OS image. It does not show a download button that implies the product is complete.</p></div>
    <section><p class="eyebrow">PHYSICAL DEVICE</p><h2>Requirements for hardware installation</h2><p>Installation requires a signed image matching the target device, original-OS recovery files, and accepted backup, restore, boot, and rollback procedures. Hardware installation will not open until all of these are ready.</p></section>
    <section><p class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER PREVIEW</p><h2>What can be tried today</h2><p>A separate Developer Preview runs in a virtual environment on a Mac. It does not install RockstarOS on a physical device or avokado mini hardware.</p><a class="button" href="/guide/">Read the Developer Preview guide ↗</a></section>
